            "tweet id": "1396092348023689220",
            "content": "this is really interesting . there are the the pricing people who forcefully argue you need to niche down , then there are others , copywriter abbey woodcock for example or alan weiss , who say , not so much . hard to judge these things .",
            "time": "21-05-22 13:15",
