        },
        {
            "comment id": 2,
            "parent": 1,
            "children": [],
            "user id": "growthcurrency",
            "tweet id": "1396093694164430850",
            "content": "and here i am saying they 're all right and wrong no single strategy works for everyone . marketing is so incredibly nuanced that you can't prescribe a solution to the masses . you have to find what works for you and your audience through consistency , feedback , and iteration .",
